    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-transform-script:app:narrative:example-example-meta-transform-script-round-trip-view:round-trip-a-transform-view" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-transform-script:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-transform-script:app:narrative:guide:working-with-metatransformscript">
      <Body>Import a view into a typed transform workspace and emit it again as SQL.

The workspace captures the view structure once. Exported SQL can be compared with the source artifact or bound to an explicit schema contract.

```powershell
meta-transform-script from sql-file --path .\views\v_customer.sql --output-xml .\Transforms.Workspace --target dbo.v_customer
meta-transform-script to sql-path --workspace .\Transforms.Workspace --out .\RoundTrippedSql
```</Body>
